			(property "Description" "The AP63356/AP63357 is a 3.5A, synchronous buck converter with a wide input voltage range of 3.8V to 32V. The device fully integrates a 74mΩ high-side power MOSFET and a 40mΩ low-side power MOSFET to provide high-efficiency step-down DC-DC conversion."
