			(property "Description" "JST 6 pin vertical connector Here is a six pin vertical 1.0mm pitch connector. It is useful if you need something very tiny as a connection. These are not the standard JST type connectors we use on most of our boards, but are actually the much smaller JST-SH type.\n\nHere is the connector we sell at SparkFun:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/579 JST SH Vertical 6-Pin Connector - SMD (GPS-00579)\n• http://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/GPS/EM406-SMDConnector-eSH.pdf Datasheet\n\nIt was used on these SparkFun products:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11818 SparkFun GPS Breakout (BOB-11818)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12081 SparkFun Weather Shield (DEV-12081)\n• And many, many other GPS related products."
